equation of the normal line to the curve $y=2 x^{2} + 2 x + 1$ at $\\left(-1,1\\right)$.\n\nGive exact values of $a$ and $b$ in $y=ax+b$.\n\n$a=$ {{slope}}\n\n$b=$ {{intercept}}"] [:db/add "e75919e2-598b-5ed9-b995-054b0382a274" :question/worked-solution "Let $f(x)=2 x^{2} + 2 x + 1$. Differentiate:\n\n$$\nf'(x)=4 x + 2\n$$\n\nEvaluate the tangent slope at the supplied abscissa:\n\n$$\nm_t=f'\\left(-1\\right)=4 \\left(-1\\right) + 2=-2\n$$\n\nThe normal is perpendicular to the tangent, so\n\n$$\nm_n=-\\frac{1}{m_t}=-\\frac{1}{\\left(-2\\right)}=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$\n\nUse the point in point-slope form and rearrange:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny-\\left(1\\right)&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(x-\\left(-1\\right)\\right)\\\\\ny&=\\frac{x}{2}+\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)+\\left(1\\right)\\\\\ny&=\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{3}{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $a=\\frac{1}{2}$ and $b=\\frac{3}{2}$."] [:db/add "e75919e2-598b-5ed9-b995-054b0382a274" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "e75919e2-598b-5ed9-b995-054b0382a274" :question/answer-fields "e99e6999-3bcd-5712-9fcf-770009234848"] [:db/add "e75919e2-598b-5ed9-b995-054b0382a274" :question/answer-fields "23f4e1d4-8f26-5d9b-a5e7-872a7121e5b8"] [:db/ensure "e75919e2-598b-5ed9-b995-054b0382a274" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186092240 :knowledge-point/questions "e75919e2-598b-5ed9-b995-054b0382a274"] [:db/add "21e6bfe9-0f5c-5f26-9a7b-81fc33101400" :answer/id #uuid "21e6bfe9-0f5c-5f26-9a7b-81fc33101400"] [:db/add "21e6bfe9-0f5c-5f26-9a7b-81fc33101400" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "21e6bfe9-0f5c-5f26-9a7b-81fc33101400" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{6}"] [:db/ensure "21e6bfe9-0f5c-5f26-9a7b-81fc33101400" :answer/validate] [:db/add "49a01165-2103-5d49-b38b-1c4c39ac14cd" :answer-field/id #uuid "49a01165-2103-5d49-b38b-1c4c39ac14cd"] [:db/add "49a01165-2103-5d49-b38b-1c4c39ac14cd" :answer-field/key "slope"] [:db/add "49a01165-2103-5d49-b38b-1c4c39ac14cd" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "49a01165-2103-5d49-b38b-1c4c39ac14cd" :answer-field/choices "21e6bfe9-0f5c-5f26-9a7b-81fc33101400"] [:db/add "49a01165-2103-5d49-b38b-1c4c39ac14cd" :answer-field/correct "21e6bfe9-0f5c-5f26-9a7b-81fc33101400"] [:db/ensure "49a01165-2103-5d49-b38b-1c4c39ac14cd" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e30409ce-a0d9-55a2-b537-8fb82bf491a9" :answer/id #uuid "e30409ce-a0d9-55a2-b537-8fb82bf491a9"] [:db/add "e30409ce-a0d9-55a2-b537-8fb82bf491a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e30409ce-a0d9-55a2-b537-8fb82bf491a9" :answer/value "\\frac{19}{3}"] [:db/ensure "e30409ce-a0d9-55a2-b537-8fb82bf491a9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7d137288-f1d0-5582-8bd7-f1424ddf44d8" :answer-field/id #uuid "7d137288-f1d0-5582-8bd7-f1424ddf44d8"] [:db/add "7d137288-f1d0-5582-8bd7-f1424ddf44d8" :answer-field/key "intercept"] [:db/add "7d137288-f1d0-5582-8bd7-f1424ddf44d8" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "7d137288-f1d0-5582-8bd7-f1424ddf44d8" :answer-field/choices "e30409ce-a0d9-55a2-b537-8fb82bf491a9"] [:db/add "7d137288-f1d0-5582-8bd7-f1424ddf44d8" :answer-field/correct "e30409ce-a0d9-55a2-b537-8fb82bf491a9"] [:db/ensure "7d137288-f1d0-5582-8bd7-f1424ddf44d8" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c80c6849-c2ca-5979-b8db-38c19e3845b0" :question/id #uuid "c80c6849-c2ca-5979-b8db-38c19e3845b0"] [:db/add "c80c6849-c2ca-5979-b8db-38c19e3845b0" :question/problem "Find the equation of the normal line to the curve $y=2 x^{2} - 2 x + 2$ at $\\left(2,6\\right)$.\n\nGive exact values of $a$ and $b$ in $y=ax+b$.\n\n$a=$ {{slope}}\n\n$b=$ {{intercept}}"] [:db/add "c80c6849-c2ca-5979-b8db-38c19e3845b0" :question/worked-solution "Let $f(x)=2 x^{2} - 2 x + 2$. Differentiate:\n\n$$\nf'(x)=4 x - 2\n$$\n\nEvaluate the tangent slope at the supplied abscissa:\n\n$$\nm_t=f'\\left(2\\right)=4 \\left(2\\right) - 2=6\n$$\n\nThe normal is perpendicular to the tangent, so\n\n$$\nm_n=-\\frac{1}{m_t}=-\\frac{1}{\\left(6\\right)}=- \\frac{1}{6}.\n$$\n\nUse the point in point-slope form and rearrange:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny-\\left(6\\right)&=- \\frac{1}{6}\\left(x-\\left(2\\right)\\right)\\\\\ny&=- \\frac{x}{6}+\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)+\\left(6\\right)\\\\\ny&=\\frac{19}{3} - \\frac{x}{6}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $a=- \\frac{1}{6}$ and $b=\\frac{19}{3}$."] [:db/add "c80c6849-c2ca-5979-b8db-38c19e3845b0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "c80c6849-c2ca-5979-b8db-38c19e3845b0" :question/answer-fields "49a01165-2103-5d49-b38b-1c4c39ac14cd"] [:db/add "c80c6849-c2ca-5979-b8db-38c19e3845b0" :question/answer-fields "7d137288-f1d0-5582-8bd7-f1424ddf44d8"] [:db/ensure "c80c6849-c2ca-5979-b8db-38c19e3845b0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186092240 :knowledge-point/questions "c80c6849-c2ca-5979-b8db-38c19e3845b0"] [:db/add "f79421bf-7936-52d6-a2fd-4941d978d414" :answer/id #uuid "f79421bf-7936-52d6-a2fd-4941d978d414"] [:db/add "f79421bf-7936-52d6-a2fd-4941d978d414" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f79421bf-7936-52d6-a2fd-4941d978d414" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}"] [:db/ensure "f79421bf-7936-52d6-a2fd-4941d978d414" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9c6a8ba6-fbd8-54af-8687-f1247e97f9c1" :answer-field/id #uuid "9c6a8ba6-fbd8-54af-8687-f1247e97f9c1"] [:db/add "9c6a8ba6-fbd8-54af-8687-f1247e97f9c1" :answer-field/key "slope"] [:db/add "9c6a8ba6-fbd8-54af-8687-f1247e97f9c1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "9c6a8ba6-fbd8-54af-8687-f1247e97f9c1" :answer-field/choices "f79421bf-7936-52d6-a2fd-4941d978d414"] [:db/add "9c6a8ba6-fbd8-54af-8687-f1247e97f9c1" :answer-field/correct "f79421bf-7936-52d6-a2fd-4941d978d414"] [:db/ensure "9c6a8ba6-fbd8-54af-8687-f1247e97f9c1" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "6f41b9e0-7c65-55b7-9920-e9e805039b51" :answer/id #uuid "6f41b9e0-7c65-55b7-9920-e9e805039b51"] [:db/add "6f41b9e0-7c65-55b7-9920-e9e805039b51" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6f41b9e0-7c65-55b7-9920-e9e805039b51" :answer/value "- \\frac{21}{5}"] [:db/ensure "6f41b9e0-7c65-55b7-9920-e9e805039b51" :answer/validate] [:db/add "52902262-ffdf-56fa-a930-7affe1dcce69" :answer-field/id #uuid "52902262-ffdf-56fa-a930-7affe1dcce69"] [:db/add "52902262-ffdf-56fa-a930-7affe1dcce69" :answer-field/key "intercept"] [:db/add "52902262-ffdf-56fa-a930-7affe1dcce69" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "52902262-ffdf-56fa-a930-7affe1dcce69" :answer-field/choices "6f41b9e0-7c65-55b7-9920-e9e805039b51"] [:db/add "52902262-ffdf-56fa-a930-7affe1dcce69" :answer-field/correct "6f41b9e0-7c65-55b7-9920-e9e805039b51"] [:db/ensure "52902262-ffdf-56fa-a930-7affe1dcce69" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c620b24a-5561-5ffa-b22a-c2bcfd7057c8" :question/id #uuid "c620b24a-5561-5ffa-b22a-c2bcfd7057c8"] [:db/add "c620b24a-5561-5ffa-b22a-c2bcfd7057c8" :question/problem "Find the equation of the normal line to the curve $y=- 2 x^{2} - x - 1$ at $\\left(1,-4\\right)$.\n\nGive exact values of $a$ and $b$ in $y=ax+b$.\n\n$a=$ {{slope}}\n\n$b=$ {{intercept}}"] [:db/add "c620b24a-5561-5ffa-b22a-c2bcfd7057c8" :question/worked-solution "Let $f(x)=- 2 x^{2} - x - 1$. Differentiate:\n\n$$\nf'(x)=- 4 x - 1\n$$\n\nEvaluate the tangent slope at the supplied abscissa:\n\n$$\nm_t=f'\\left(1\\right)=- 4 \\left(1\\right) - 1=-5\n$$\n\nThe normal is perpendicular to the tangent, so\n\n$$\nm_n=-\\frac{1}{m_t}=-\\frac{1}{\\left(-5\\right)}=\\frac{1}{5}.\n$$\n\nUse the point in point-slope form and rearrange:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny-\\left(-4\\right)&=\\frac{1}{5}\\left(x-\\left(1\\right)\\right)\\\\\ny&=\\frac{x}{5}+\\left(- \\frac{1}{5}\\right)+\\left(-4\\right)\\\\\ny&=\\frac{x}{5} - \\frac{21}{5}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $a=\\frac{1}{5}$ and $b=- \\frac{21}{5}$."] [:db/add "c620b24a-5561-5ffa-b22a-c2bcfd7057c8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "c620b24a-5561-5ffa-b22a-c2bcfd7057c8" :question/answer-fields "9c6a8ba6-fbd8-54af-8687-f1247e97f9c1"] [:db/add "c620b24a-5561-5ffa-b22a-c2bcfd7057c8" :question/answer-fields "52902262-ffdf-56fa-a930-7affe1dcce69"] [:db/ensure "c620b24a-5561-5ffa-b22a-c2bcfd7057c8"